            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Step Two—If the grievant is not satisfied with the disposition in Step One, he/she may file his/her grievance in writing to the MCCSSE within five (5) duty days. The MCCSSE, within five (5) duty days from such filing, shall meet and counsel the grievant on the merits of the grievance and if the Union deems it to be meritorious, forward the grievance to the appropriate deputy superintendent or appropriate associate superintendent. If the grievance is referred within the time limits, the appropriate deputy superintendent or appropriate associate superintendent shall have five (5) duty days to respond to the grievant.",
