        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. If the grievant is not satisfied with the disposition of the grievance made by the superintendent, he/she may again file it in writing with the MCCSSE WITHIN FIVE (5) duty days for that Union's decision on whether or not the grievance shall be submitted to arbitration.",
